    "On recorder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在录音豆上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On your recorder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在录音豆上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One Markdown file per recording with the summary and the transcript, for example in an Obsidian vault. Audio stays in the library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每条录音一个 Markdown 文件，包含摘要和转写，例如放进 Obsidian 知识库。音频仍留在录音库里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One term per line: names, product names, jargon. OpenBean fixes same-sounding names and spelling to these without an LLM, in voice typing and in library transcripts (where only terms of three or more characters are fixed by sound); clean-up prefers them too. For a word it keeps mishearing, add what it hears after an equals sign: Claude Code = cloud code, 克劳德 code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行一个词：人名、产品名、术语。不用大模型也会把读音相同的错字和英文写法改成这些词，语音输入和录音库的转写都用（转写里只按读音纠正三个字以上的词）；润色时也优先用它们。总被认错的词，在等号后面写上它被认成的样子：Claude Code = cloud code, 克劳德 code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only files OpenBean created for voice typing are deleted. Deleted audio can't be recovered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只删 OpenBean 为语音输入新建的文件，删了不能恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only needed for cloud services": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅云端服务需要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
