            "value": "正在同步第 %1$lld/%2$lld 条，约剩 %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing recordings from the recorder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在从录音豆同步录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在同步：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take it out of its case. OpenBean finds it over Bluetooth.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把它从充电盒里拿出来，OpenBean 会通过蓝牙找到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the recorder out of its case to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把录音豆从充电盒里拿出来就会连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the recorder out of its case to connect. Its recordings show up here after you sync them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把录音豆从充电盒里拿出来就会连接，同步后录音会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the recorder out of its case, or press the button on the case to wake it. OpenBean keeps looking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把录音豆从充电盒里拿出来，或按一下充电盒的按钮唤醒它。OpenBean 会一直找。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the recorder out of its case. OpenBean finds it over Bluetooth — no pairing in System Settings needed. If macOS asks for Bluetooth access, allow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把录音豆从充电盒里拿出来。OpenBean 会通过蓝牙找到它，不需要在系统设置里配对。如果系统询问蓝牙权限，请允许。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The LLM service did not answer: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大模型服务没有响应：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The LLM service is not reachable. Check Settings → Clean-up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连不上大模型服务，请检查「设置 → 润色」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The LLM service rejected the API key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大模型服务拒绝了 API Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection dropped": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接断了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model's reply could not be used. Try again or use a larger model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型的回复无法使用，请重试或换一个更大的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recorder is already recording. Press its button to stop, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆正在录音。先按录音豆上的按键停止，再开始语音输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recorder is recording. Stop it first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆正在录音，请先停下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recorder isn't connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆没连上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recorder stopped answering.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆没有回应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server address in Clean-up is not valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「润色」里的服务器地址无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text of each sentence is sent to %@. Audio and speech recognition stay on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每句话的文字会发送到 %@；录音和语音识别仍在这台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These files were never downloaded to this Mac. Some may have been continued by later voice typing, so they can be longer than one dictation. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些文件没有下载到本机。有的被后来的语音输入续写过，可能比一次语音输入长。删除后不能恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build doesn't include openbean-mcp. Build the app with bin/build-app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个版本里没有 openbean-mcp，请用 bin/build-app 编译 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone. The copy on this Mac is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除后不能恢复。这台 Mac 上的副本会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This note was edited after OpenBean wrote it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这份笔记在 OpenBean 写入之后被改过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording is still on your recorder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条录音还在录音豆上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording is too short to summarise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条录音太短，没有可摘要的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the text kept on this Mac. It does not change anything you already typed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只删除保存在这台 Mac 上的文字，不影响已经输入出去的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本周"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week: %lld times · %lld characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本周：%1$lld 次 · %2$lld 字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timeline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title, summary, key points and action items, written by the LLM service set up in Clean-up. Skipped when the service is not running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由「润色」里设置的大模型服务生成标题、摘要、要点和待办事项；服务没开时跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To put text where your cursor is, macOS needs to let OpenBean send keystrokes. Turn on OpenBean under Privacy & Security → Accessibility (on some versions: Device Control and Data Access).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要把文字打进光标处，macOS 需要允许 OpenBean 发送按键。请在「隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能」（部分版本叫 Device Control and Data Access）里打开 OpenBean。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To-dos": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待办"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today groups recordings by day. With 4:00 AM, a conversation at 2 AM still counts as the day before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「今天」按天整理录音。设成凌晨 4 点时，凌晨两点的谈话算前一天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
